            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已是教練，可在「教練」選單中與球館合作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "profile_identities_apply_coach_intro": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coaches partner with venues, publish coaching services and run private sessions. Tell us about your coaching experience."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les coachs s’associent à des salles sportifs, publient leurs services et organisent des séances privées. Présentez votre expérience."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "教练可与球馆合作、发布授课服务并安排私教课，请介绍你的执教经历。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "教練可與球館合作、發佈授課服務並安排私教課，請介紹你的執教經歷。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
